<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-21T13:59:58.737Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:59:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Turkish forces continue to hold positions in Syria and Iraq, saying they will stay until border security is guaranteed, while armed groups have used explosive-laden drones to strike Syrian security posts in Suwayda. Israel is now backing Druze forces against President al-Sharaa, and Iranian Kurdish separatists have been deported to Iraq. Qatar’s intelligence chief says the country overhauled its entire defence system in six hours. DNA testing has identified seven family members killed in Syria, offering hope to the missing. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/20/qatar-revamped-its-entire-defence-system-in-six-hours-intelligence-chief-reveals&quot;&gt;euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPV3RKR2pUa2wwUm5ORTJlYW9zeWFYclNSMzlRdUpXMnJvYVVWV1ozaV8ydnBQQXkyTkJzdVZDMlpmY1I1aFN5MkE1akJPNTdTak9YTG0tWFNrOEJBdGVoRkVVazg2TUpSZnQ4U25kRVVRRDkyR0JoRl8yMU4tTXNHMEU4NDVRXy1OVlF6VEtzTDNxaW9rSklsbHJxcDlhamxDUUdjUGZtbDRIUnQ5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcTR4clZBOEdCRzVZSE9DV0ZUR0UzMllpT0Fic1BWc3A4WjhjOXNZWTBvLTBpX05yQ3JMRzlHNzEzUHZDRXlJWi1BTEhmMnVaOVBnUFVIYkFBUVQtd3o5TjRxZkdTd2d5NlVWajBOREhrX0xLTVVyaEJfVkRnQ0FSeld4NG9McG5ScGUwNnZOdmFRdGRGcFlMTmF5SVV1dkZ5LTdlS3pfanJnelJNMUVVazFYeUxBdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Arab Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOTzgtV2hQSDFsc2oweU94OEpITHg2UVM4bWk1LWozdDBQSUpkRlpaSjNnQkMxYnc3RHRDN2NRSEZRVHJFRHpGdXV2RG13UDhzN2lEQjZ1VkRhS1I0aUR1bzZjallFTHNIRHpjX2lVS2E3OTB2dUdDTkZUcmh4Q1VRZUJ4OVV5RVNRVzVOSGYzTUZYeERybHFhXzdxMUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;کردپرس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h